# Engagement data, flags and VPN credentials never belong in the repository.
# `campaigns/` is listed here before anything writes to it on purpose: a working
# copy can hold a live campaign while checked out on a branch that predates the
# feature, and an ignore rule that arrives with the feature arrives too late.
engagements/
campaigns/
flags.local.md
vpn/

# Your own learnings. Ignored by default so nothing leaves this machine by
# accident; `pwnloop ship` force-adds them when you choose to push to your fork.
memory/local.md
docker/packages.local.txt

# Your list of terms that must never be committed — lab domains, hostnames,
# machine names. Ignored because a list of what must not leak would leak it.
.redact.local
!vpn/.gitkeep
*.ovpn
*.log
.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
